&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="usage-shortcuts"&gt;Usage Shortcuts&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="usage-shortcuts"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#usage-shortcuts" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
